  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Conflict &#x2013; Isolated People through Assuring Milk in the House ...</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This initiative will facilitate purchase 2,025 quintals of animal feed that will support 1,500 households for 3 months (90 days) supply of concentrated animal feed for 5 goats per household (300 Grams of feed per day &#x2013; 7,500 goats): 900 households in Magaale; 600 households in Eli Da&apos;ar.  Community health workers will distribute the feeds while clan leaders and local government are verifying the lists and distribution. Post distribution monitoring will be undertaken by Afar Pastoralist Development Association (APDA) so that the selection and distribution is correctly carried out.</narrative>
  </description>
